title: Host Contacting Remus Botnet Gateway Domain (mylunora.art)
id: 8f9aa7e1-95cc-42a6-9b58-6999359591c9
status: experimental
description: >
    Detects a network connection to mylunora.art, the Vercel-hosted
    "installation guide" gateway used by the Remus botnet distribution
    campaign. Over 100 cloned GitHub repositories posing as game mods and
    Windows utilities point victims to this domain, which hands out the
    password for a password-protected Release.zip archive attached to the
    repository's GitHub Release - the encryption keeps the Remus payload out
    of reach of GitHub's static scanners. A hit means a user was steered
    toward the encrypted payload, so treat the host as exposed.
references:
    - https://threatfox.abuse.ch/ioc/1973657/
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026/10/29
tags:
    - attack.t1608
    - attack.t1105
logsource:
    category: network_connection
detection:
    selection:
        DestinationHostname|endswith: 'mylunora.art'
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - Threat-intel research, sandbox detonation, URL scanners or analyst pivots that deliberately visit the reported gateway domain
level: high
